#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:35
msgid "Renderer outputs at a glance"
msgstr "渲染器输出概览"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:37
msgid ""
"The galleries below use the same authored scene, camera, lights, materials, "
"and initial conditions. Six spheres exercise mirror-like, transparent, semi-"
"transparent, matte, glossy, and emissive materials. The RGB output is "
"animated to show the spheres falling onto the table; the remaining outputs "
"are still frames from the same run. Stills use the sixth rendered frame so "
"temporal outputs, such as motion vectors, show useful motion while the "
"spheres remain near their initial poses."
msgstr ""
"下方示例使用相同的场景、相机、光源、材质和初始条件。六个球体分别展示镜面、透明、半透明、哑光、光泽和自发光材质。RGB "
"动画展示球体落到桌面上的过程，其余输出为同一次运行中的静帧。静帧取自第六个渲染帧，以便运动向量等时序输出包含有效运动，同时球体仍接近初始位姿。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:43
msgid ""
"Treat the images as a qualitative comparison of feature coverage and image "
"character, not a performance benchmark. The kit-less renderers use Newton "
"physics while Isaac RTX uses PhysX, so the exact sphere poses can differ. "
"Display-only color maps make scalar, vector, and label outputs readable "
"here; camera sensors still return their documented raw tensors. Closely "
"related aliases and distance or ID variants are omitted because they do not "
"add a visually distinct mode."
msgstr ""
"这些图像用于定性比较功能支持和画面特征，不是性能测试。不依赖 Kit 的渲染器使用 Newton 物理，Isaac RTX 使用 "
"PhysX，因此球体的精确位姿可能不同。这里使用仅用于显示的色图，使标量、向量和标签输出易于观察；相机传感器仍返回文档所述的原始张量。相近的别名，以及距离或"
" ID 的变体没有逐一列出，因为它们不会呈现明显不同的视觉模式。"

