#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:54
msgid "Renderer details"
msgstr "渲染器详情"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:56
msgid ""
"Open a renderer below for its execution model, output coverage, limitations,"
" and typical use case. The gallery above remains a visual comparison; the "
"camera support matrix is the authoritative output-by-backend reference."
msgstr "展开下方渲染器条目，查看执行方式、输出支持、限制和典型用途。上方图像只用于视觉比较，相机支持矩阵才是各后端输出支持的权威依据。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:0
msgid "Newton Warp renderer"
msgstr "Newton Warp 渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:62
msgid ""
"**Runtime and physics:** A lightweight, kit-less rasterizer built on NVIDIA "
"Warp and paired with Newton physics."
msgstr "**运行时与物理：** 基于 NVIDIA Warp 的轻量光栅化渲染器，不依赖 Kit，与 Newton 物理配合使用。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Output coverage:** Produces RGB, albedo, depth, normals, semantic "
"segmentation, and instance segmentation. It does not produce motion vectors "
"or RTX material transport. Its focused raster pipeline exposes fewer ground-"
"truth outputs than the RTX renderers, which integrate broader RTX and "
"annotator capabilities."
msgstr ""
"**输出支持：** 提供 RGB、反照率、深度、法线、语义分割和实例分割，不提供运动向量或 RTX 材质光传输。其精简的光栅化流程所提供的真值输出少于 "
"RTX 渲染器，后者集成了更广泛的 RTX 和标注器功能。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:68
msgid ""
"**Best for:** Training workflows where throughput matters more than full RTX"
" fidelity."
msgstr "**适用场景：** 吞吐量比完整 RTX 保真度更重要的训练流程。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:0
msgid "OVRTX renderer"
msgstr "OVRTX 渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:72
msgid ""
"**Runtime and physics:** Provides kit-less RTX rendering through the "
"``isaaclab_ov`` extension and pairs with Newton physics."
msgstr "**运行时与物理：** 通过 ``isaaclab_ov`` 扩展提供不依赖 Kit 的 RTX 渲染，与 Newton 物理配合使用。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Output coverage:** Provides RTX Minimal and photo-real rendering with "
"geometry, motion, and label outputs."
msgstr "**输出支持：** 提供 RTX Minimal 和逼真渲染，以及几何、运动和标签输出。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:76
msgid "**Best for:** RTX image quality without running Isaac Sim."
msgstr "**适用场景：** 无需运行 Isaac Sim 即可获得 RTX 图像质量。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:0
msgid "Isaac RTX renderer"
msgstr "Isaac RTX 渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:80
msgid ""
"**Runtime and physics:** Runs NVIDIA's Omniverse RTX rendering pipeline "
"inside Isaac Sim and pairs with PhysX."
msgstr "**运行时与物理：** 在 Isaac Sim 内运行 NVIDIA Omniverse RTX 渲染流程，与 PhysX 配合使用。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Output coverage:** Provides RTX Minimal and photo-real rendering, plus the"
" broadest camera-output coverage."
msgstr "**输出支持：** 提供 RTX Minimal、逼真渲染，以及最广泛的相机输出支持。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Best for:** Full RTX fidelity and workflows that already depend on Isaac "
"Sim or Kit."
msgstr "**适用场景：** 完整 RTX 保真度，以及已经依赖 Isaac Sim 或 Kit 的工作流程。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:87
msgid "Choosing a rendering capability"
msgstr "选择渲染功能"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:89
msgid ""
"The overview above shows the complete range of visually distinct outputs in "
"one place. The sections below regroup those outputs by purpose: simplified "
"rendering for throughput-oriented training, photo-real rendering for full "
"RTX image quality, and advanced outputs for geometry, motion, and labels. "
"The detailed captions and commands use the suffixless ``Isaac-Cartpole-"
"Camera`` task so each shown mode can be tried without editing Python."
msgstr ""
"上方概览集中展示了所有视觉上不同的输出。下方按用途重新分组：面向高吞吐量训练的简化渲染、提供完整 RTX "
"图像质量的逼真渲染，以及几何、运动和标签等高级输出。详细图注和命令使用不带后缀的 ``Isaac-Cartpole-Camera`` 任务，无需修改 "
"Python 即可尝试各模式。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:96
msgid "Simplified rendering"
msgstr "简化渲染"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:98
msgid ""
"Simplified rendering prioritizes throughput and predictable image formation "
"over full light transport. Newton Warp provides a lightweight rasterized RGB"
" path. OVRTX and Isaac RTX provide RTX Minimal mode, which disables indirect"
" lighting and offers three levels of material evaluation:"
msgstr ""
"简化渲染优先考虑吞吐量和可预测的成像，而非完整光传输。Newton Warp 提供轻量的光栅化 RGB 路径。OVRTX 和 Isaac RTX 提供 "
"RTX Minimal 模式，关闭间接光照，并提供三个层级的材质求值："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:102
msgid "**Constant diffuse** uses one constant surface color."
msgstr "**常量漫反射** 使用单一的恒定表面颜色。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Diffuse MDL** is Isaac Lab's stable name for textured diffuse shading."
msgstr "**漫反射 MDL** 是 Isaac Lab 对带纹理漫反射着色所采用的稳定名称。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:104
msgid ""
"**Full MDL** is Isaac Lab's stable name for diffuse, glossy, and emissive "
"material evaluation."
msgstr "**完整 MDL** 是 Isaac Lab 对漫反射、光泽和自发光材质求值所采用的稳定名称。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:106
msgid ""
"RTX Minimal uses the first distant light in the scene and hard shadows. See "
"the upstream `OVRTX Minimal mode <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/ovrtx/sensors/cameras/render_modes/minimal.html>`_ and "
"`RTX Minimal renderer <https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-"
"rendering/latest/rtx-renderer_minimal.html>`_ documentation for the "
"renderer-level settings and limitations."
msgstr ""
"RTX Minimal 使用场景中的第一个远光源，并采用硬阴影。渲染器级设置和限制见上游 `OVRTX Minimal 模式 "
"<https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/ovrtx/sensors/cameras/render_modes/minimal.html>`_ 与 "
"`RTX Minimal 渲染器 <https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/materials-and-"
"rendering/latest/rtx-renderer_minimal.html>`_ 文档。"

