#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:218
msgid "Isaac RTX textured-diffuse RTX Minimal output."
msgstr "Isaac RTX 带纹理漫反射 RTX Minimal 输出。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:226
msgid "Isaac RTX full-material RTX Minimal output."
msgstr "Isaac RTX 完整材质 RTX Minimal 输出。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:254
msgid "Photo-real rendering"
msgstr "逼真渲染"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:256
msgid ""
"Here, **photo-real rendering** means the regular RGB path from the full RTX "
"Real-Time Path-Tracing mode; it is a capability grouping, not an Isaac Lab "
"preset name. Choose it when material appearance, reflections, transparency, "
"lighting, or the accompanying RTX AOVs matter more than the lowest possible "
"render latency. OVRTX provides this path without Kit, while Isaac RTX "
"provides it inside Isaac Sim. See the upstream `OVRTX render modes "
"<https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/ovrtx/sensors/cameras/render_modes.html>`_ and `Isaac "
"Sim rendering modes "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/reference_material/rendering_modes.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"这里的 **逼真渲染** 指完整 RTX 实时路径追踪模式的常规 RGB 路径；它是功能分类，不是 Isaac Lab "
"预设名称。当材质外观、反射、透明度、光照或附带的 RTX AOV 比最低渲染延迟更重要时，选择这种方式。OVRTX 在不使用 Kit "
"的情况下提供此路径，Isaac RTX 则在 Isaac Sim 内提供。请参阅上游 `OVRTX 渲染模式 <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/ovrtx/sensors/cameras/render_modes.html>`_ 与 `Isaac Sim "
"渲染模式 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/reference_material/rendering_modes.html>`_"
" 。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:274
msgid "OVRTX photo-real RGB — ``renderer=ovrtx presets=rgb``"
msgstr "OVRTX 逼真 RGB： ``renderer=ovrtx presets=rgb``"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:276 source/concepts/renderers.rst:293
msgid ""
"The same renderer also produces the albedo, depth, normals, segmentation, "
"and motion-vector outputs shown in the overview gallery."
msgstr "同一渲染器也提供概览图中的反照率、深度、法线、分割和运动向量输出。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:291
msgid "Isaac RTX photo-real RGB — ``renderer=isaacsim_rtx presets=rgb``"
msgstr "Isaac RTX 逼真 RGB： ``renderer=isaacsim_rtx presets=rgb``"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:302
msgid "Advanced rendering outputs"
msgstr "高级渲染输出"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:304
msgid ""
"Beyond RGB, renderer-produced buffers expose material, geometry, motion, and"
" labeling information:"
msgstr "除 RGB 外，渲染器生成的缓冲区还提供材质、几何、运动和标注信息："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:306
msgid "**Albedo** isolates the material base color from lighting."
msgstr "**反照率** 将材质基础色与光照分离。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:307
msgid ""
"**Depth** measures optical-axis distance for geometric perception and "
"reconstruction."
msgstr "**深度** 测量沿光轴的距离，用于几何感知和重建。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:308
msgid "**Normals** encode local surface orientation."
msgstr "**法线** 表示局部表面朝向。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:309
msgid ""
"**Semantic segmentation** groups pixels by class, while **instance "
"segmentation** separates individual objects."
msgstr "**语义分割** 按类别划分像素， **实例分割** 则区分各个物体。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:311
msgid ""
"**Motion vectors** encode image-space motion per pixel and require prior-"
"frame history."
msgstr "**运动向量** 表示每个像素在图像空间中的运动，需要前一帧历史信息。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:313
msgid ""
"Request one or more buffers through :attr:`~sensors.CameraCfg.data_types`. "
"See :ref:`camera-configuration` for a configuration example and "
":ref:`camera-output-types` for the available names, tensor shapes, data "
"types, and meanings. Environment-level ``presets=...`` selectors are task-"
"defined convenience shortcuts, not an exhaustive list of camera outputs."
msgstr ""
"通过 :attr:`~sensors.CameraCfg.data_types` 请求一个或多个缓冲区。配置示例见 :ref:`camera-"
"configuration` ，可用名称、张量形状、数据类型和含义见 :ref:`camera-output-types` 。环境级 "
"``presets=...`` 选择器是任务定义的便捷方式，不是全部相机输出的完整列表。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:318
msgid ""
"Output availability differs by backend. Check the :ref:`camera renderer "
"support matrix <camera-supported-annotators>` before choosing a renderer; "
"for example, OVRTX and Isaac RTX produce motion vectors, while Newton Warp "
"does not. The :ref:`renderer visual comparison <renderer-visual-comparison>`"
" above shows these outputs on the same scene."
msgstr ""
"各后端支持的输出不同。选择渲染器前，请检查 :ref:`相机渲染器支持矩阵 <camera-supported-annotators>` "
"。例如，OVRTX 和 Isaac RTX 提供运动向量，Newton Warp 不提供。上方 :ref:`渲染器视觉比较 <renderer-"
"visual-comparison>` 展示了同一场景中的这些输出。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:325
msgid ""
"Visualization markers are debug overlays provided by visualizers, not camera"
" outputs. Their support is independent of the camera renderer: the Kit, "
"Newton GL, Rerun, and Viser visualizers support markers, while the "
"experimental Newton RTX visualizer does not. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/visualization` for the visualizer support matrix."
msgstr ""
"可视化标记是可视化器提供的调试叠加内容，不是相机输出。其支持情况独立于相机渲染器：Kit、Newton GL、Rerun 和 Viser "
"可视化器支持标记，实验性的 Newton RTX 可视化器不支持。可视化器支持矩阵见 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/visualization` 。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:331
msgid ""
"**Temporal information for camera-based RL.** Unlike RTX modes with temporal"
" anti-aliasing (DLSS, DLAA, TAA), the Newton Warp renderer does not inject "
"prior-frame information into the current image. Camera-control tasks that "
"depend on velocity-like visual cues should add explicit temporal "
"observations (e.g. task-local frame stacking) rather than relying on "
"renderer-specific artifacts."
msgstr ""
"**基于相机的强化学习中的时序信息。** 与采用时序抗锯齿的 RTX 模式（DLSS、DLAA、TAA）不同，Newton Warp "
"渲染器不会将前一帧信息引入当前图像。依赖速度等视觉线索的相机控制任务，应显式添加时序观测，例如在任务中叠帧，而不是依赖特定渲染器产生的画面特征。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:338
msgid "Per-environment Isaac RTX scene partitioning"
msgstr "Isaac RTX 按环境划分场景"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:340
msgid ""
"The Isaac RTX renderer enables per-environment scene partitioning by "
"default. It assigns matching scene-partition tokens to each "
"``/World/envs/env_<index>`` hierarchy and its camera so tiled views render "
"only that environment's geometry."
msgstr ""
"Isaac RTX 渲染器默认启用按环境划分场景，为每个 ``/World/envs/env_<index>`` "
"层级及其相机分配匹配的场景分区标记，使平铺视图仅渲染对应环境的几何。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:344
msgid ""
"Configure the behavior through "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.renderers.IsaacRtxRendererCfg`:"
msgstr "通过 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.renderers.IsaacRtxRendererCfg` 配置该行为："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:352
msgid ""
"Scene partitioning and the all-environment spectator view are separate "
"controls. :class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` enables spectator support"
" before RTX startup only when the Kit viewport is enabled or Kit "
"visualization, recording, livestreaming, or XR is requested. Regular "
"headless training and camera-sensor runs keep it disabled so tiled cameras "
"are not exposed to the spectator mode's world-space layout constraints."
msgstr ""
"场景分区与显示所有环境的观察视图是两个独立设置。只有启用 Kit 视口，或请求 Kit 可视化、录制、直播流或 XR 时， "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` 才会在 RTX "
"启动前启用观察模式支持。常规无界面训练和相机传感器运行保持该功能关闭，使平铺相机不受观察模式世界空间布局约束的影响。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:358
msgid ""
"``global_settings.show_all_partitions_by_default`` maps to that same "
"process-global RTX setting; it is not a separate feature. Its default value "
"of ``None`` preserves the launch-time choice made by "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher`. An explicit value overrides that "
"setting when the Isaac RTX renderer is constructed. When enabled, "
"environments must remain spatially separated because overlapping partition "
"bounds can make content leak into another environment or disappear. When "
"disabled, the Kit viewport displays only the selected environment."
msgstr ""
"``global_settings.show_all_partitions_by_default`` 对应同一个进程级全局 RTX "
"设置，并不是独立功能。其默认值 ``None`` 保留 :class:`~isaaclab_physx.app.KitLauncher` "
"在启动时的选择。显式赋值会在构建 Isaac RTX "
"渲染器时覆盖该设置。启用时，环境必须在空间上分开，因为分区边界重叠可能使内容出现在其他环境中或消失。关闭时，Kit 视口只显示选中的环境。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:366
msgid ""
"This setting does not affect OVRTX, which always partitions multi-"
"environment scenes."
msgstr "此设置不影响 OVRTX；OVRTX 始终对多环境场景进行分区。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:368
msgid ""
"Prims outside the environment hierarchies remain in the shared background "
"partition. Environment-owned ``PointInstancer`` markers can carry one "
"matching scene-partition token per instance; markers without that ownership "
"information remain shared."
msgstr ""
"环境层级之外的 prim 保留在共享背景分区中。环境持有的 ``PointInstancer`` "
"标记可以为每个实例携带一个匹配的场景分区标记；没有此类所有权信息的标记保持共享。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:374
msgid ""
"The Isaac RTX and OVRTX renderers cap the number of scene partitions at "
"15625. Requesting more than 15625 environments with scene partitioning "
"enabled discards the additional partitions, and ``rtx.scenedb.plugin`` logs "
"``SceneDbContext : Maximum number of scene partitions (15625) reached. "
"Additional scene partitions will be discarded.`` Environments beyond that "
"count then share a partition with another environment, so their tiled camera"
" views can show another environment's geometry. See :ref:`known-issues-"
"scene-partition-count-cap` for details."
msgstr ""
"Isaac RTX 与 OVRTX 渲染器将场景分区数量限制为 15625。启用场景分区时，如果请求超过 15625 个环境，多出的分区会被丢弃， "
"``rtx.scenedb.plugin`` 会记录 ``SceneDbContext : Maximum number of scene "
"partitions (15625) reached. Additional scene partitions will be discarded.``"
" 。超过该数量的环境会与其他环境共享分区，因此其平铺相机画面可能显示其他环境的几何。详情见 :ref:`known-issues-scene-"
"partition-count-cap` 。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:383
msgid "Architecture Overview"
msgstr "架构概览"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:385
msgid "The renderer system consists of:"
msgstr "渲染器系统由以下部分组成："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:387
msgid ""
"**BaseRenderer** — Abstract base class defining the rendering lifecycle and "
"interface"
msgstr "**BaseRenderer** ：定义渲染生命周期和接口的抽象基类。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:388
msgid ""
"**RendererCfg** — A ``BackendCfg`` subclass; each backend extends it with "
"backend-specific options and declares its implementation in ``class_type``"
msgstr ""
"**RendererCfg** ： ``BackendCfg`` 的子类；各后端扩展它以提供专用选项，并在 ``class_type`` "
"中声明具体实现。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:390
msgid ""
"**Concrete implementations** — Backend-specific renderers in extension "
"packages"
msgstr "**具体实现** ：扩展软件包中的后端专用渲染器。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:391
msgid ""
"**SimulationContext** — Owns renderer instances in its backend registry and "
"shares them across equal configurations of the same concrete type through "
"``get_or_create_backend(renderer_cfg)``."
msgstr ""
"**SimulationContext** ：在后端注册表中持有渲染器实例，通过 "
"``get_or_create_backend(renderer_cfg)`` ，在具体类型相同且配置相等的请求之间共享实例。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:393
msgid ""
"**RenderContext** — Coordinates initialization, stage preparation, scene "
"updates, and material writers using a filtered view of the simulation "
"registry. It does not construct, cache, or close renderer instances."
msgstr ""
"**RenderContext** ：通过仿真注册表的过滤视图，协调初始化、舞台准备、场景更新和材质写入器，不负责构建、缓存或关闭渲染器实例。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:408
msgid "For the RTX renderer (requires Isaac Sim):"
msgstr "使用 RTX 渲染器时（需要 Isaac Sim）："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:421
msgid ""
"For RTX renderer settings, see :doc:`/source/how-to/configure_rendering`."
msgstr "RTX 渲染器设置见 :doc:`/source/how-to/configure_rendering` 。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:427
msgid "Batching camera renders"
msgstr "批量渲染相机"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:429
msgid ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.render_batch` accepts a sequence of "
"render-data objects owned by the same renderer. Prepare the camera poses, "
"intrinsics, and shared scene state before rendering, then read each camera's"
" output. An empty sequence performs no rendering."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.render_batch` "
"接受同一渲染器持有的一组渲染数据对象。渲染前准备相机位姿、内参和共享场景状态，之后读取各相机输出。空序列不会触发渲染。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:439
msgid ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.render` continues to accept a single"
" render-data object. The default ``render_batch()`` implementation calls "
"``render()`` for each entry, so existing custom renderers and single-camera "
"callers need no changes. OVRTX steps all registered render products together"
" but publishes only the requested cameras' observations."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.render` 仍接受单个渲染数据对象。默认的 "
"``render_batch()`` 实现逐项调用 ``render()`` ，因此已有自定义渲染器和单相机调用方无需修改。OVRTX "
"同时推进所有已注册渲染产品，但只发布所请求相机的观测。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:444
msgid ""
"With eager sensor updates (``scene.cfg.lazy_sensor_update=False``), "
"``scene.update()`` advances sensor clocks in scene order and collects batch-"
"capable sensors. After the loop, the camera batch implementation prepares "
"the remaining due captures for submission. "
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.RenderContext.render_into_cameras` groups these "
"requests by renderer instance, renders each group, and reads its outputs. "
"The context does not retain a pending-camera queue. Each camera retains its "
"own update period and reset state."
msgstr ""
"主动更新传感器时（ ``scene.cfg.lazy_sensor_update=False`` ）， ``scene.update()`` "
"按场景顺序推进传感器时钟，并收集支持批处理的传感器。循环结束后，相机批处理实现会准备其余到期的采集请求。 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.RenderContext.render_into_cameras` "
"按渲染器实例分组，渲染各组并读取输出。上下文不保留待处理相机队列，每个相机维护自己的更新周期和重置状态。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:451
msgid ""
"With lazy sensor updates, reading a camera's ``data`` refreshes only that "
"camera's sensor buffers and capture timestamps. It does not refresh peer "
"camera sensors sharing the renderer."
msgstr "按需更新传感器时，读取相机的 ``data`` 只刷新该相机的传感器缓冲区和采集时间戳，不会刷新共享渲染器的其他相机传感器。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:455
msgid "Core concepts"
msgstr "核心概念"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:457
msgid ""
"**Use the simulation registry**: Always acquire renderers with a renderer-"
"specific config class through "
"``sim_ctx.get_or_create_backend(IsaacRtxRendererCfg())``. Do not import or "
"instantiate concrete backend classes (e.g. ``IsaacRtxRenderer``, "
"``OVRTXRenderer``) directly—their names and package locations are "
"implementation details and may change without notice."
msgstr ""
"**使用仿真注册表：** 始终通过 ``sim_ctx.get_or_create_backend(IsaacRtxRendererCfg())`` "
"等方式，使用渲染器专用配置类获取渲染器。不要直接导入或实例化具体后端类，例如 ``IsaacRtxRenderer`` 、 "
"``OVRTXRenderer`` ；类名和软件包位置属于实现细节，可能不经通知就改变。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:462
msgid ""
"**Lightweight config imports**: Importing a renderer configuration class "
"does not pull in backend-specific dependencies. ``class_type`` is resolved "
"lazily when the renderer is constructed, and construction may fail if the "
"backend is not installed."
msgstr ""
"**轻量配置导入：** 导入渲染器配置类不会引入后端专用依赖。 ``class_type`` 在构建渲染器时按需解析，后端未安装时，构建可能失败。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:478
msgid "Installing the OVRTX renderer"
msgstr "安装 OVRTX 渲染器"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:480
msgid ""
"The OVRTX renderer is provided by the ``isaaclab_ov`` extension. The "
"extension's source package ships with the core install, but the renderer's "
"``ovrtx`` runtime wheel (the `ovrtx <https://github.com/NVIDIA-"
"Omniverse/ovrtx>`_ package, published on public PyPI) is **not** installed "
"by default. You must request it explicitly — OVRTX does **not** require "
"Isaac Sim."
msgstr ""
"OVRTX 渲染器由 ``isaaclab_ov`` 扩展提供。扩展源码包随核心安装发布，但渲染器的 ``ovrtx`` 运行时 wheel（公开 "
"PyPI 上发布的 `ovrtx <https://github.com/NVIDIA-Omniverse/ovrtx>`_ 软件包）默认 **不会**"
" 安装，必须显式选择。OVRTX **不需要** Isaac Sim。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:486
msgid "Install via the Isaac Lab CLI using the ``ov[ovrtx]`` token:"
msgstr "通过 Isaac Lab CLI 使用 ``ov[ovrtx]`` 选项安装："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:495
msgid ""
"The bare ``ov`` token does **not** install any runtime wheel (the source "
"packages are already part of the core install). Use ``ov[ovrtx]`` (or "
"``ov[all]``) to pull in the ``ovrtx`` dependency."
msgstr ""
"单独使用 ``ov`` 选项 **不会** 安装任何运行时 wheel，因为源码包已包含在核心安装中。请使用 ``ov[ovrtx]`` 或 "
"``ov[all]`` 安装 ``ovrtx`` 依赖。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:499
msgid "Or install the public ``ovrtx`` package directly from PyPI:"
msgstr "也可以直接从 PyPI 安装公开的 ``ovrtx`` 软件包："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:503
msgid ""
"**Opaque render data**: The render data object returned by "
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.create_render_data` is passed to "
"subsequent renderer methods. It should be completely opaque to the caller: "
"inspecting or modifying it via get/set attributes is an anti-pattern and "
"breaks the API contract."
msgstr ""
"**不透明渲染数据：** :meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.create_render_data` "
"返回的渲染数据对象传给后续渲染器方法。调用方应将其视为完全不透明的对象；通过属性读写检查或修改它是不恰当的用法，会破坏 API 约定。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:509
msgid ""
"The :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` class is under active "
"development and may change without notice."
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer` 仍在积极开发，可能不经通知就改变。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:514
msgid "Asynchronous Rendering"
msgstr "异步渲染"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:516
msgid ""
":attr:`~isaaclab_ov.renderers.OVRTXRendererCfg.async_rendering` returns a "
"camera's previous capture while rendering its next image. This allows "
"rendering to overlap simulation and Python work. The first capture, "
"including after reset, waits for a fresh image. The ovstage path stays "
"synchronous."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~isaaclab_ov.renderers.OVRTXRendererCfg.async_rendering` "
"在渲染下一张图像时，返回相机的前一次采集结果，使渲染能够与仿真及 Python 工作重叠。首次采集（包括重置后的首次采集）会等待新图像，ovstage "
"路径保持同步。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:520
msgid ""
"Latency is one capture, not necessarily one physics or control step. State "
"observations remain current, so enabling this option changes the policy's "
"observation timing; training may need to account for that delay. Physics and"
" policy computation may also use the GPU."
msgstr ""
"延迟为一次采集，不一定等于一个物理步或控制步。状态观测仍是当前值，因此启用此选项会改变策略观测的时序，训练可能需要考虑该延迟。物理与策略计算也可能使用 "
"GPU。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:524
msgid ""
"For a camera capturing once per environment step, steady-state operation is:"
msgstr "对于每个环境步采集一次的相机，稳态运行过程如下："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:533
msgid ""
"The first image is returned immediately after priming and repeated once on "
"the next capture."
msgstr "首次准备完成后立即返回第一张图像，下一次采集时会再返回一次。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:535
msgid ""
"Each camera owns its pending observations. Reading camera A never changes "
"camera B's pixels or metadata, even when they share a native render "
"submission. Reset discards that camera's pending observations. A partial "
"environment reset re-primes the whole tiled camera product, without "
"invalidating other cameras."
msgstr ""
"每个相机持有自己的待发布观测。读取相机 A 不会改变相机 B "
"的像素或元数据，即使它们共享一次原生渲染提交。重置丢弃该相机的待发布观测。部分环境重置会重新准备整个平铺相机产品，不会使其他相机失效。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:540
msgid ""
"Live fields such as ``camera.data.pos_w`` and "
"``camera.data.intrinsic_matrices`` remain current. Use the capture metadata "
"when pairing delayed pixels with a pose or calibration, for example when "
"deprojecting depth:"
msgstr ""
"``camera.data.pos_w`` 、 ``camera.data.intrinsic_matrices`` "
"等实时字段仍是当前值。将延迟像素与位姿或标定配对时，应使用采集元数据，例如进行深度反投影时："

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:552
msgid ""
"Capture metadata remains unchanged on later captures. Direct renderer "
"callers use :meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.prepare_capture` before "
"submitting a capture and "
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.read_output` to publish it."
msgstr ""
"之后的采集不会改变已有采集元数据。直接调用渲染器时，在提交采集前使用 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.prepare_capture` ，通过 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.renderers.BaseRenderer.read_output` 发布结果。"

#: source/concepts/renderers.rst:556
msgid ""
"SDP fills renderer-owned transform and geometry buffers, including "
"deformable meshes, particles, and cables. Two buffers alternate per write "
"and are reused only after OVRTX consumes them. Physics can therefore update "
"its live arrays while the previous capture renders."
msgstr ""
"SDP 填充渲染器持有的变换与几何缓冲区，包括可变形网格、粒子和线缆。两个缓冲区在每次写入时交替使用，只有 OVRTX "
"消费完后才能复用。因此，物理仿真可以在前一次采集仍在渲染时更新实时数组。"

